WEBVTT

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:30.000
E: [Laser noise]

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.000
(Laughter)

00:01:34.229 --> 00:01:36.659
SW: Yeah, yeah. 
That was pretty funny, Einstein.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:40.550
Now, Einstein also thinks, you know,

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:42.730
working in caves 
and travelling through space --

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:44.548
it's all very dangerous jobs.

00:01:44.548 --> 00:01:47.000
It would be very dangerous 
if you fell down.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.690
E: Wheeeeeee! [Splat]

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:50.640
SW: Yeah.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:52.000
(Laughter)

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.970
Little splat at the end there. 
Einstein, did that hurt?

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:54.780
E: Ow, ow, ow.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:56.890
SW: Yeah. It's all a lot of hard work.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:57.850
E: [Squawks]

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.261
SW: Yeah. It can get a bird 
like Einstein frustrated.